  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">State Bank of India (SBI) has released the notification for the post of Specialist Cadre Officers SCO Assistant Manager Engineer. This recruitment has been issued for 169 posts. Candidates Can Also Check All Details on Official<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">&nbsp;Sarkari Result 2025</a> website which is SarkariExam.com. Those Candidates Are Interested in the following recruitment can apply online from the link given below.</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">State Bank of India (SBI)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">SBI Assistant Manager Engineer Recruitment 2024</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Notification Date : <strong>21 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Application Start Date : <strong>22 November 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Last Date : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>12 December 2024</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>12 December 2024</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Exam Date : <strong>Notify Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Admit Card : <strong>Before Exam</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>General, EWS, OBC <strong>: Rs. 750/-</strong></li>\n<li>SC, BC <strong>: Rs. 0/-</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">As on 01 October 2024</span></strong></li>\n<li>Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>30 Years for Civil / Electrical</strong></li>\n<li>Maximum Age : <strong>40 years for Fire Post</strong></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Relaxation as per SBI Assistant Manager Engineer Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li>Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 169 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><strong>No. of Post</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Assistant Manager Engineer (Civil / Electrical / Fire) <strong>Regular Post</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">168</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">Assistant Manager Engineer (Civil / Electrical / Fire) <strong>Backlog Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\">01</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Candidates having Bachelor Degree in Engineering in Relevant Trade / Branch with Minimum 60% Marks from any recognized university / college will be considered for this post.</li>\n<li>Experience Required (Post Wise)</li>\n<li>All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Candidates can apply through link https://sbi.co.in or provided below in link section or they can also apply through official site of the SBI before Last Date.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">You Can Check other <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sarkari Result 2025</a> Notification Here – <a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"https://www.sarkariexam.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check Now.</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">For all the interested and eligible candidates who want to apply for SBI Assistant Manager Engineer recruitment can read all the information related to the recruitment is given below and the link to apply is given in the Important Link section below.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Written Exam/ Shortlisting</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Interaction/ Interview</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Medical Examination</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://instagram.com/sarkariexam.com_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://ibpsonline.ibps.in/sbiscooct24/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"cen